    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Crookhaven has long been a cosmopolitan and sought after destination here in glorious West Cork. Famous for its sailing, water sports, seafood, beautiful beaches and scenic walks. The area offers a sense of escape and tranquility, the perfect retreat, and now ‘Marconi House’ is looking for someone new to be part of its history.\r\nIn the early 1900s ‘Marconi House’ was home to radio pioneer Guglielmo Marconi. The Italian inventor and electrical engineer, better known as ‘Father of the Wireless’. It was here that Marconi first set up one of his first wireless stations and succeeded in transmitting signals across the Atlantic for the first time.\r\nThe property is currently laid out in three apartments overlooking Crookhaven harbour.\r\nAlternatively, there is the potential to revert this historic building back to a single private residence.\r\n \r\nAccommodation:\r\nGround Floor 2 bed apartment: \r\nKitchen (3.4m x 2m)\r\nLiving/Dining room (7.5m x 3.5m)\r\nBedroom 1 with built in storage (2.7m x 3.1m)\r\nShower room with electric shower, WHB & WC (1.5m x 3.2m)\r\nMain Bedroom 2 with built in wardrobes (5m x 3m)\r\n\r\nFirst Floor 1 bed apartment with sea views:\r\nLiving room (4.8m x 3m)\r\nKitchen/ Dining room (2.4m x 3m)\r\nBedroom with sea views (3.2m x 3m)\r\nBathroom with shower, WC and WHB (1.5m x 3.2m)\r\n\r\nSecond Floor 1 bed apartment:\r\nKitchen (2.5m x 2.5m)\r\nDining/Living (2.7m x 5m)\r\nBedroom (3.4m x 3.2m) with ensuite shower, WC & WHB (2.4m x 1.5m)\r\n\r\nAdditional features:\r\nCar parking spaces, private garden, rear patio area.\r\n\r\nAll information is provided in good faith and believed to be correct; however, it is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No representations or warranties, express or implied, are made as to the accuracy, completeness, condition, or planning status of the property.\r\nInterested parties should investigate independently as to the accuracy of all details, including measurements, boundaries, area, BER rating, and available services. In addition, all apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services should be thoroughly tested to asses their working condition. \r\nPhotographs and videos are for guidance  purposes only  and may show items (such as furniture) that are not included in the sale unless specifically agreed between the parties."
      },
